sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Programmer
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    P->>UI: open the View tab
    UI->>S: setActiveTab(1)
    loop every refresh (200 ms, after a scan)
        S-->>UI: controller changed
        UI->>S: lines, controllers, blockModel, outputs, suggestionRows, overrides
        S->>W: inputs and outputs of the last scan
        W-->>S: occupancy, closures, suggestions, commands
        S-->>UI: rows (speeds converted to mph)
        UI-->>P: block grid, outputs, CTC suggestions, overrides, mode
    end
    Note over UI,W: Read only. The values are what the Track Model and CTC sent on the last scan (UC-10, UC-11, UC-12).
